tic Caches' 'I177') #(flavour '"Practically perfect in every way. As long as you never miss." 13 /  /  / -Changing weapon again during the said 10 seconds will cancel the buff.' 'J177'))) #('C180' 'Regulus' pistol exotic nil #(#(weaponClassLabel 'Pistol' 'A173') #(variant 'Magnum' 'B179') #(name 'Regulus' 'C180') #(talentOrAttribute 'Regicide / Headshot Kills create a 5m explosion, dealing 400% weapon damage and applying bleed to all enemies hit.' 'E179') #(exoticMods 'Magazine: +10% Reload speed / Muzzle: +20% Accuracy' 'F179') #(minor 'Any Basic' 'G179') #(acquisition '- Iron Horse Raid Project' 'I179') #(flavour '"Cast your stones  / at king on thrones.  / but at the end / rats gnaw on our bones." / -Javier Kajika /  / - Full name: Javier Kajika''s Regulus / - Blueprint flavour text : "Kajika''s Regulus revolver is one of a kind, but with the right parts and materials, we can make it two of a kind." -Inaya / - The phrase "cast your stones" seems to be a reference to John 8:7. In this verse, Jesus says "let he who is without sin  / cast the first stone." This line not only stops a stoning, but exposes the hypocrisy of the stoners. / - In this flavour text Kajika exposes the hypocrisy of The Division, which seeks to overthrow various hostile factions / ("kings") yet themselves have no accountability (due to the President having betrayed them). As such The Division, just / like other factions, can be said to operate on its own whims and is therefore no different. / - The last line simply laments how pointless all the fighting and death is in a savage world where one could die at any time.' 'J179'))) #('C181' 'Tempest' pistol exotic nil #(#(weaponClassLabel 'Pistol' 'A173') #(variant 'M93R' 'B181') #(name 'Tempest' 'C181') #(talentOrAttribute 'Restrained: / The pistol is fully automatic and deals +25% Amplified Damage for 20s after your Shield gets broken.' 'E181') #(exoticMods 'Magazine: +50% Stability / Muzzle: +15% Critical Hit Chance' 'F181') #(minor 'Any Basic' 